{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/followers-title.png?t=1759834228\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/followers-gif.gif?t=1759834228\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the wild world of influencer culture, where fame is just a click away! In this idler clicker you will build your empire by growing your follower base and watch your popularity soar as the processes get automated. Every follower brings you closer to becoming the ultimate social media sensation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/upgrades-title.png?t=1759834228\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/upgrades-gif.gif?t=1759834228\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for slow and steady when you can dominate the game with powerful upgrades? Unlock and buy upgrades to supercharge your clicks, posting skills and follower power. <br>Each upgrade brings new ways to grow your empire, making your journey to the top faster and more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/hashtags-title.png?t=1759834228\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/tags-gif.gif?t=1759834228\" /></span>In the unpredictable world of social media, every milestone brings a new opportunity. Complete challenges to unlock random perks that boost your next fresh hashtag run.  With a wide variety of perks to discover, no two playthroughs are the same. Strategize, adapt, and push your influence to new heights as you tackle harder hashtags with better perk tiers.<br><br>On top of that, the full game includes:<br>a choice of 4 characters to play with, each with their own special abilities;<br>unlockable recipes that make each run unique;<br>AFK mode;<br>In-game purchases that dramatically boost your early runs;<br><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534950?t=1759834228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/958f9f8f39eb9ed1d531eb47cd1dde67cad86916/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759834228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/cda927cc2770b5623b09a45ef65c3535a614d773/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759834228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/cda927cc2770b5623b09a45ef65c3535a614d773/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759834228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3966750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/followers-title.png?t=1759834228\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/followers-gif.gif?t=1759834228\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the wild world of influencer culture, where fame is just a click away! In this idler clicker you will build your empire by growing your follower base and watch your popularity soar as the processes get automated. Every follower brings you closer to becoming the ultimate social media sensation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/upgrades-title.png?t=1759834228\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/upgrades-gif.gif?t=1759834228\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for slow and steady when you can dominate the game with powerful upgrades? Unlock and buy upgrades to supercharge your clicks, posting skills and follower power. <br>Each upgrade brings new ways to grow your empire, making your journey to the top faster and more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/hashtags-title.png?t=1759834228\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534950/extras/tags-gif.gif?t=1759834228\" /></span>In the unpredictable world of social media, every milestone brings a new opportunity. Complete challenges to unlock random perks that boost your next fresh hashtag run.  With a wide variety of perks to discover, no two playthroughs are the same. Strategize, adapt, and push your influence to new heights as you tackle harder hashtags with better perk tiers.<br><br>On top of that, the full game includes:<br>a choice of 4 characters to play with, each with their own special abilities;<br>unlockable recipes that make each run unique;<br>AFK mode;<br>In-game purchases that dramatically boost your early runs;<br><br></p>","developers":["Austris O.-Anderson"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"h